# 🎤 OPIc Question - Day17

## Question

Tell me about a place you visited recently.

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- Where you went
- When you went
- Who you went with
- What you did
- What you noticed
- How you felt

---

## Challenge

Use today's expression:

> One thing I noticed was that...

---

## Recommended Structure

I recently went to...

↓

I went there with...

↓

We...

↓

One thing I noticed was that...

↓

Overall, I really enjoyed the experience because...
